# Adobe After Effects Projects

Welcome to my **After Effects projects** repo!  

## What’s inside
- **Logo Animations** – smooth, minimal, and modern intro/outro animations.  
- **Motion Graphic Edits** – transitions and UI-style animations inspired by iPhone/tech aesthetics.  

## To watch the videos:
-  Click the file name  
- Press **Download** to view it locally  
or  
[Watch previews on Google Drive](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DhEWNdc75o5AMhYeXmRNK58vHs690C43?usp=drive_link)


